rfps.md
# `docs/*` rather than `docs/`, so a single file can be un-excluded below. Git does not
# descend into an excluded DIRECTORY, so a negation under a plain `docs/` would never fire.
docs/*
# The operator-facing deployment topology (story 1.6 / AD-17). It SHIPS: it is the doc that
# gives every process a named host, every relayer job its degrade state, and the cold-start
# caveat somewhere an operator or a reviewer will actually meet it — which is the whole point
# of writing it. It is neither research nor competitive analysis, so the rule above does not
# describe it. Everything else under docs/ (the retired Superpowers plans) stays excluded.
!docs/topology.md

# Upstream sources cloned for ground truth — not ours to ship
reference/
